            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Creiamo un link scegliendo le opzioni nell'ordine corretto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Link1\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"2\" /><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"39\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;a</code>, seguito da <code>href</code> e poi <code>=</code>, <code>\"https://example.com\"</code>, <code>&gt;</code>, <code>Link1</code>, <code>&lt;/a&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
